OL,4,G1800FThe Classic FM Hall of Fame 2026
OL,5,     GAcross the Easter weekend, we
OL,6,     Gcontinue to count down the
OL,7,     Gworld's biggest classical music
OL,8,     Gchart: The Classic FM Hall of
OL,9,     GFame.
OL,10,G2100FTotally Outrageous with Tom Allen
OL,11,     GComedian Tom Allen presents some
OL,12,     Gof the most extraordinary stories
OL,13,     Gbehind classical music, from
OL,14,     Glarger-than-life legends to
OL,15,     Gdownright divas.
OL,16,G2200FCalm Classics with Myleene Klass
OL,17,     GMyleene presents her selection of
OL,18,     Gcalming classical music to help
OL,19,     Gyou wind down at the end of the
OL,20,     Gday.
